# Technical nouns and verbs of ETIA-JAX for the STE checker (one per line).
size          # of a statistical test: the rejection rate under the null
power         # of a statistical test: the rejection rate under the alternative
conditioning  # conditioning set Z of a CI query
logarithmic
batched       # batched JAX call (vmap over queries)
query
queries
graph
orient
separating     # separating set
return         # a function returns a value
call           # a function call
discriminating   # discriminating path
list             # a Java List
fixture        # a reference file of Tetrad outputs
